flowchart TD

    DEV["Developer<br/>Local repository"]

    GH["GitHub<br/>main branch"]

    CI["GitHub Actions<br/>CI/CD pipeline"]

    OIDC["GitHub OIDC<br/>Temporary AWS credentials"]

    S3["Amazon S3<br/>Private model artifacts"]

    BUILD["Docker Buildx<br/>Linux ARM64 image"]

    ECR["Amazon ECR<br/>Container registry"]

    ECS["Amazon ECS / Fargate<br/>clinical-ai-service"]

    API["FastAPI Inference Service<br/>Port 8000"]

    MODEL["Multimodal Predictor<br/>ResNet-18 + TF-IDF/LR<br/>80/20 late fusion"]

    CW["Amazon CloudWatch<br/>Logs + CPU/Memory monitoring"]

    CLIENT["API Client"]

    DEV -->|git push| GH

    GH --> CI

    CI -->|tests pass| OIDC

    OIDC -->|assume IAM role| S3

    S3 -->|download model artifacts| BUILD

    CI --> BUILD

    BUILD -->|push Docker image| ECR

    ECR -->|deploy image| ECS

    ECS --> API

    API --> MODEL

    CLIENT -->|GET /health| API
    CLIENT -->|POST /predict| API

    API -->|JSON probabilities| CLIENT

    ECS -->|container logs| CW
    API -->|request status + latency| CW
    ECS -->|CPU + memory metrics| CW